## Task 1: Give the owner full permissions only.
-rwx------ 700 secret.txt
## Task 2: Give everyone read permission.
-rwxr--r-- 744 secret.txt
## Task 3: Remove write permission for group and others.
-rwxr--r-- 744 secret.txt
## Task 4: Make the file executable only for the owner.
-rwxr--r-- 744 secret.txt
